### The Nine Homeomorphism Classes

| Class | Letters | Z-profile signature |
|-------|---------|---------------------|
| Arc $\cong [0,1]$ | C, G, I, J, L, M, N, S, U, V, W, Z | 0 points Z≥3, 2 isolated Z=1, 0 open arcs in {Z=1} |
| Circle $\cong S^1$ | D, O | 0 points Z≥2, all points Z=1 |
| Y-tree | E, F, T, Y | 1 point Z=3, 3 isolated Z=1, 0 open arcs |
| H-tree | H | 2 points Z=3, 4 isolated Z=1, 0 open arcs |
| X-tree | K, X | 1 point Z=4, 4 isolated Z=1, 0 open arcs |
| P-shape (circle + tail) | P, Q | 0 points Z≥3, 1 isolated Z=1, 1 open arc |
| A-shape (cycle + 2 legs) | A | 0 points Z≥3, 2 isolated Z=1, 2 open arcs |
| R-shape (cycle + 2 legs, deg-4 junction) | R | 1 point Z=3, 2 isolated Z=1, 1 open arc |
| B-shape (2 cycles + tail) | B | 0 points Z≥3, 1 isolated Z=1, 2 open arcs |

